Blackmagic DeckLink SDK 16.0 - Linux headers
============================================

The files in include/ are the unmodified contents of the Linux/include/
folder of the Blackmagic DeckLink SDK 16.0, obtained from
https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/desktopvideo_sdk. Nothing else from the
SDK (samples, examples, documentation, EULA) is included here.

Each file carries its own licence notice at the top. Those licences permit
use, reproduction, distribution and sub-licensing, provided the copyright
notice and licence statement are kept in all copies. Do not edit or strip
these notices.

Clause 0.1 of the SDK's End User License Agreement states that its
restrictive clauses (1, 4.3, 4.4, 5, 7 and 8) do not apply to the files in
the SDK's /Mac/Include, /Win/Include and /Linux/Include sub-folders.

